# Normalize all text to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Rationale: the worklog telemetry measures by line; CRLF drift would
# poison byte-level comparisons (and historically hid JS `$`-vs-\r parse bugs).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
